    *   Bicyclic system \\(< 8\\) Carbons: Bridgehead \\(sp^2\\) is **Hypothetical** (Narial/Non-real).
    *   Bicyclic system \\(\ge 8\\) Carbons: Bridgehead \\(sp^2\\) is **Real**.

*   **Intermediate Stability Priority:**
    *   **Carbocations:** \\(+R > +H > +I\\).
    *   **Carbanions:** \\(-R > -I\\). (Note: **\\(H\\)-effect never applies to carbanions**).
