| --------------------               | ---------            | ----------------------------------                              |
| **Cumulated diene**  | C=C=C         | CH₂=C=CH₂ (allene) | (shares one carbon) |
| **Conjugated diene** | C=C–C=C     | CH₂=CH–CH=CH₂ (1,3-butadiene) | (double bonds separated by one single bond)|
